{
  "EpisodeId": 1050118,
  "StoryType": 1,
  "Order": 18,
  "Prev": 1050117,
  "Next": 1050119,
  "Chapter": "最终章",
  "Title": "琼浆倾注之处",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1050118001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "接下来是天狼星的公演吗……。/n山吹纱蒙亲手创立的剧团，究竟会展现出怎样的光芒，值得一看。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "2220",
      "BgmFileName": "5",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｂ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是啊，确实令人期待。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｂ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "毕竟天狼星虽然规模并不算大，/n却培养出了不少Dai Star，是个有着悠久传统的剧团。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｃ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是啊，如今新妻八惠仍在团内，/n而近来暂时离开舞台的柊望有，过去应该也曾是成员。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｂ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这么一来，就更让人移不开眼了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……各位，差不多请安静下来。/n天狼星的帷幕就要拉开了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "105",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「嗯，诸神的武勇确实都十分出色，值得赞赏……。/n　不过若论弓箭之术，恐怕无人能胜过我的妹妹阿耳忒弥斯。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（首先，就由我来让你们见识一下吧。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「的确，阿耳忒弥斯在狩猎时的弓术无可挑剔。/n　可若是在战场上，狩猎用的弓可就不管用了。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「所以，最优秀的弓箭手果然还是我这位军神阿瑞斯。/n　我才是最擅长驾驭弓箭的神！！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｃ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（这是……卡特莉娜·格利贝尔的Sense吗……！/n　仿佛每一幕都能被牢牢展现在眼前……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "知冴",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「是！您叫我吗，阿瑞斯大人！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "106"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「我问你。/n　阿耳忒弥斯与阿瑞斯，究竟谁才是更优秀的弓箭手？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「往你认为更优秀的那一方酒杯里，献上琼浆。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "知冴",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「这可难办了。阿耳忒弥斯大人和阿瑞斯大人的弓术都非常出色。/n　我实在无法选出一方。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "106"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "知冴",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「若倒给阿耳忒弥斯大人，阿瑞斯大人会不高兴；若倒给阿瑞斯大人，/n　阿波罗大人肯定又会不高兴。那我到底该怎么办……」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "106"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（她是……流石知冴吗。Horoscope Season时虽然/n　没能拿下Dai Star之位，但实力果然毋庸置疑。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「你们两个都停下吧。/n　伽倪墨得斯都被你们弄得很为难了。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「既然要让人类来评判高下，/n　那就找人类的代理人吧。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「请卡斯托耳和波吕丢刻斯来做你们的代理人。两人在相同的环境中长大，/n　武艺登峰造极，还共同分享着一份不死之身……」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「这样就公平了吧？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「原来如此，那我没有异议。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「能想到这样的办法，真不愧是我的妹妹。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "潘达",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「请交给我们！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "105"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "潘达",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「那就来比射靶吧。若卡斯托耳先射中，就是阿波罗大人获胜。/n　若波吕丢刻斯先射中，就是阿瑞斯大人获胜，如何？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "105"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "観客",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（这个舞台的对话节奏真好，看得人很开心。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "潘达",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（听观众的反应，这里就把喜剧感再加强一点吧。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "105"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "潘达",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「嘿！可恶，射偏了。阳光太刺眼，根本瞄不准靶子。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "105"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "潘达",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「看来今天弓弦的状态不太好啊。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "105"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｂ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（那个叫柳场潘达的演员，/n　似乎很擅长把观众的期待也利用进自己的表演里。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（每一位演员都拥有出色的演技和Sense。/n　可其中尤其出类拔萃的……是凤心菜。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（她提升了所有共演者的Sense，/n　把整个舞台推向了更高的层次……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「明明是卡斯托耳和波吕丢刻斯的比赛，为什么你反而射中了靶子！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「竟敢搅乱这场认真较量！岂有此理！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "知冴",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「非、非常抱歉！我究竟该怎样谢罪才好……」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "106"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「是我给伽倪墨得斯施加了庇护。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「阿耳忒弥斯……！？/n　为什么！？你有什么不满吗！？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「哥哥是为了证明你的弓术无人能敌，/n　才特意举办这场比赛的！到底为什么……！？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180380",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 43,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「我有拜托你替我比赛吗？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180390",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 44,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「这、这个……！可是，我怎么能眼睁睁看着阿瑞斯那种家伙/n　轻视我的妹妹……我这都是为了你……！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180400",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118045,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 45,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「请适可而止！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180410",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118046,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 46,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「再说，你们嘴上说是什么认真较量，可哥哥明明故意加强了阳光，/n　妨碍波吕丢刻斯射中靶子吧？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180420",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118047,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 47,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「唔！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180430",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118048,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 48,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「轮到卡斯托耳时，阿瑞斯大人还故意发出胜利的呐喊，/n　甚至偷偷换掉卡斯托耳的弓弦作弊——这些我全都知道。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180440",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118049,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 49,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「那、那是……！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180450",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118050,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 50,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「这场比赛判伽倪墨得斯获胜。/n　双方都没有意见吧。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180460",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118051,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 51,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（这个剧团里，还有一个更加异质的存在……那个名叫静香的演员。/n　她与凤心菜似乎相似，却又截然不同……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180470",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118052,
