    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118053,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 53,
      "SpeakerName": "静香",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「那么，伽倪墨得斯，作为这场比赛的胜者，/n　就由我来为你斟上琼浆吧。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180480",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "102"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118054,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 54,
      "SpeakerName": "知冴",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「谢谢您，阿耳忒弥斯大人。/n　谢谢您替我解围。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180490",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "106"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118055,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 55,
      "SpeakerName": "知冴",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「咕噜……好清爽。这是我从未喝过的味道。/n　这就是一直滋润诸神喉咙的……真好喝。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180500",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "106"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118056,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 56,
      "SpeakerName": "观众们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "噢噢噢噢……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180510",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118057,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 57,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "凤心菜……真是个厉害的演员。她一边提升所有共演者的Sense，/n一边又以主演身份展现出了卓越的演技。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180520",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118058,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 58,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "还有静香。每当她回应凤小姐的演技，/n两人的表演便彼此相连，绽放出更耀眼的光芒……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180530",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118059,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 59,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｂ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "流石小姐甚至把会场里的气氛都融入了演技。/n这正是因为她对舞台拥有极为敏锐的感知，才能做到的表演吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180540",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118060,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 60,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｃ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "Sense也都闪耀得很好。柳场潘达应该同时听见了演员与观众……/n两边内心的声音吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180550",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118061,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 61,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｃ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "即使是剧本中没有的台词，也提升了舞台整体的完成度。/n……同时，她又展现出不会被那些心声吞没的坚定演技。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180560",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118062,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 62,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｂ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "如果要谈Sense，也不能漏掉卡特莉娜小姐。那份出色的表演，/n无疑来自她异于常人的专注力。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180570",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118063,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 63,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "各位，非常感谢大家观看天狼星的舞台！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180580",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 10103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "101"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118064,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 64,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "无论舞台整体的完成度、每个人的演技水平，/n还是把Sense巧妙融入其中的表演设计，都十分出色。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180590",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118065,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 65,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而其中尤其值得一提的，是主演凤小姐。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180600",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118066,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 66,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你成为了支撑演技与整体表演设计的一根主柱，/n并绽放出了强烈的光芒。非常精彩。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180610",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050118067,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050118,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 67,
      "SpeakerName": "心菜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……！/n……非常感谢！！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501180620",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
